. 
. foreach v of varlist kidsex01-kidsex19 {
  2.     gen  `v'_c = `v'               // copy child's sex (1 = boy, 2 = girl)
  3.     replace `v'_c = . if `v'_c < 0 // convert negative missings to .
  4. }       
(10,637 real changes made, 10,637 to missing)
(17,351 real changes made, 17,351 to missing)
